WEBVTT

00:20.350 --> 00:24.390
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:24.390 --> 00:30.090
♪ May we pass by the magnificent scenery ♪

00:30.980 --> 00:35.140
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:35.140 --> 00:40.910
♪ Could it be that both of us
are filled with desolation? ♪

00:41.790 --> 00:45.630
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:45.630 --> 00:51.400
♪ May we lead such a life ♪

00:52.350 --> 00:56.520
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:56.520 --> 01:01.900
♪ Turning back, you and I ♪

01:05.740 --> 01:07.270
♪ Seize the current moment ♪

01:07.270 --> 01:10.920
♪ The sky is painted
with a gentle pallet of pastel colors ♪

01:10.920 --> 01:15.920
♪ Let's walk together ♪

01:16.360 --> 01:17.970
♪ Even if ♪

01:17.970 --> 01:21.660
♪ The snow in front of us ♪

01:21.680 --> 01:23.170
♪ Will dye our hair white ♪

01:23.170 --> 01:27.210
♪ In an instant ♪

01:27.210 --> 01:28.310
[Joy of Life Season 2]

01:28.310 --> 01:30.780
[Adapted from Mao Ni's Joy of Life
on Yuewen Group's Qidian platform]

01:30.780 --> 01:34.139
[Episode 19]

01:34.159 --> 01:36.520
You have to eat well down there.

01:37.000 --> 01:38.880
Did you miss me?

01:40.280 --> 01:42.440
You have to take good care of yourself.

01:43.759 --> 01:46.679
Mother, I'm back.

01:48.759 --> 01:51.039
Why are you back
in the middle of the day?

01:52.280 --> 01:54.240
Can't I return in the day?

02:00.050 --> 02:04.370
[Grave of Fan Sizhe]

02:05.000 --> 02:05.920
This...

02:05.920 --> 02:07.360
What do you mean by this?

02:20.160 --> 02:21.600
Fan Xian?

02:23.920 --> 02:25.000
What?

02:25.279 --> 02:27.199
Is it time for me to die?

02:28.399 --> 02:29.200
I don't even know

02:29.200 --> 02:30.519
what kind of image

02:30.519 --> 02:32.600
I have in your mind.

02:37.239 --> 02:37.939
Father!

02:37.959 --> 02:39.440
Father, I'm back!

02:46.040 --> 02:47.120
You!

02:48.040 --> 02:51.000
You still got arrested in the end, huh?

02:51.960 --> 02:53.600
In the end? What does that mean?

02:56.040 --> 02:58.819
I knew this day would arrive eventually

02:58.839 --> 03:02.320
after you said you wanted
to assassinate Mr. Fan.

03:04.679 --> 03:06.720
Thank you, Mr. Fan.

03:07.200 --> 03:09.799
Thank you for sparing my son.

03:09.880 --> 03:13.400
Father, the assassination
is all in the past now.

03:13.600 --> 03:15.919
Now, I'm serving him.

03:21.439 --> 03:22.959
I see.

03:24.360 --> 03:25.639
My son

03:26.439 --> 03:27.979
is foolish and ignorant.

03:27.999 --> 03:29.659
But Mr. Fan, you actually
forgave his past mistakes

03:29.679 --> 03:30.979
and gave him a chance.

03:30.999 --> 03:33.120
You're truly magnanimous.

03:33.800 --> 03:35.680
Why don't you two chat over here?

03:36.480 --> 03:37.720
Okay.

03:39.760 --> 03:40.840
Father,

03:41.160 --> 03:43.120
I'm useful.

03:43.399 --> 03:46.860
I've been lurking within the capital
of Northern Qi all this while.

03:46.880 --> 03:49.280
[Guo Youzi, ex-Minister of Rites]
Why did you go there?

03:50.080 --> 03:51.979
I was managing the secret scouts

03:51.999 --> 03:54.639
and overseeing the collection
of confidential information.

03:57.999 --> 03:58.819
Really?

03:58.839 --> 04:00.219
That's right, Father.

04:00.239 --> 04:02.259
My infiltration

04:02.279 --> 04:04.079
has been flawless.

04:12.320 --> 04:13.720
Northern Qi,

04:14.200 --> 04:15.419
is it going to fall?

04:15.439 --> 04:17.120
It's not that bad.

04:17.400 --> 04:18.480
Father,

04:18.559 --> 04:21.719
seems like you don't trust me.

04:21.759 --> 04:23.099
It's been many years,

04:23.119 --> 04:25.639
yet you still don't understand
what I'm capable of.

04:29.920 --> 04:31.000
Father!

04:31.239 --> 04:32.519
What's wrong?

04:35.079 --> 04:36.920
This isn't a dream, huh?

04:44.720 --> 04:46.880
I think I'm mentally drained.

04:46.999 --> 04:49.040
How did I fall asleep
and dream during the day?

04:51.720 --> 04:53.079
But that's fine.

04:53.199 --> 04:55.059
I can see you in my dream again.

04:55.079 --> 04:57.199
I'm happy.

05:00.119 --> 05:01.199
Mother,

05:02.199 --> 05:03.639
you aren't dreaming.

05:03.720 --> 05:05.120
I've returned for real.

05:05.800 --> 05:07.580
They better don't wake me up right now.

05:07.600 --> 05:08.539
Mother,

05:08.559 --> 05:10.000
this isn't a dream.

05:23.600 --> 05:24.680
Mother,

05:25.239 --> 05:26.719
why did you hit me?

05:27.400 --> 05:28.780
It doesn't hurt when you're in a dream.

05:28.800 --> 05:29.920
Does it hurt?

05:30.119 --> 05:31.320
It does.

05:36.199 --> 05:37.380
My son,

05:37.400 --> 05:39.240
you're truly back!

05:39.280 --> 05:40.299
This is great!

05:40.319 --> 05:40.639
Wait.

05:40.640 --> 05:43.270
It's useless for you to hit me
when it's your dream, right?

05:44.319 --> 05:44.879
Let me pinch you.

05:44.879 --> 05:45.439
Don't!

05:45.439 --> 05:46.040
Mother.

05:46.040 --> 05:47.619
- That hurts.
- One more time!

05:47.639 --> 05:48.659
Stop crying.

05:48.679 --> 05:49.679
I'm glad that you're back.

05:49.679 --> 05:51.140
I'll make something nice for you.

05:51.160 --> 05:51.999
No need for that.

05:51.999 --> 05:52.940
You mustn't tell anyone else.

05:52.940 --> 05:54.820
I came back in secret this time around.

05:54.840 --> 05:56.440
I see.

05:58.079 --> 06:00.859
Eldest Princess and Second Prince
are actually allies.

06:00.879 --> 06:02.639
This is truly unexpected.

06:03.400 --> 06:04.480
Father,

06:04.679 --> 06:06.820
Second Prince is in
a dispute with Fan Xian.

06:06.840 --> 06:09.159
He'll set him up during the spring exam.

06:09.999 --> 06:11.219
You have to help him out.

06:11.239 --> 06:12.179
He promised

06:12.199 --> 06:14.719
that he would release you
once the exam is over.

06:21.239 --> 06:22.839
Mr. Guo, what are you doing?

06:24.679 --> 06:28.000
Mr. Fan, I want to thank you
for rescuing my son.

06:28.199 --> 06:30.599
He's not rescuing me. He's rescuing you.

06:30.800 --> 06:32.380
It doesn't matter
whether I get out or not.

06:32.400 --> 06:34.599
As long as my son can survive,

06:34.999 --> 06:36.940
I'm willing

06:36.960 --> 06:38.519
to sacrifice my life.

06:40.800 --> 06:42.260
I'm a man of my word.

06:42.280 --> 06:43.759
I'll definitely rescue you.

06:58.960 --> 07:01.179
Mr. Fan, you said

07:01.199 --> 07:03.839
that Guo Zheng gave you a manual.

07:03.960 --> 07:07.440
May I have a look?

07:11.550 --> 07:15.095
[Details of the spring exam]

07:22.040 --> 07:23.120
Father,

07:23.360 --> 07:24.219
how is it?

07:24.239 --> 07:26.040
Many of the details

07:26.040 --> 07:27.140
listed here are correct.

07:27.160 --> 07:28.859
So, can Fan Xian accomplish the deed

07:28.879 --> 07:30.800
just by following the manual?

07:33.160 --> 07:36.299
However, it doesn't contain rules

07:36.319 --> 07:38.159
outside of the spring exam.

07:43.879 --> 07:45.920
If so, they must be trying to harm you.

07:46.199 --> 07:48.380
Who does Guo Zheng serve?

07:48.400 --> 07:52.360
Judging from what I saw in the past,
it didn't seem like he was serving anyone.

07:52.520 --> 07:54.030
His intention is well-hidden.

07:54.600 --> 07:56.219
Father, let's forget about him, then.

07:56.239 --> 07:57.319
Hurry and tell Mr. Fan

07:57.319 --> 07:58.539
about the other rules.

07:58.559 --> 08:01.099
He needs to rescue you after this.

08:01.119 --> 08:02.719
There's no rush.

08:03.800 --> 08:05.450
I have a question.

08:05.470 --> 08:06.859
Mr. Fan, how many of your proteges

08:06.879 --> 08:09.580
are attending the exam this time?

08:09.600 --> 08:11.480
I don't have any proteges.

08:12.960 --> 08:14.219
Not a single one?

08:14.239 --> 08:15.040
I'm too young

08:15.040 --> 08:16.460
to be a mentor.

08:16.480 --> 08:18.859
It's a good thing for you
not to be involved with the candidates.

08:18.879 --> 08:20.839
It saves you from a lot of trouble.

08:29.199 --> 08:32.320
Mr. Fan, are you reminded of something?

08:34.880 --> 08:37.800
I did meet some
of the candidates a few days ago.

08:40.150 --> 08:41.520
Did you only meet them?

08:42.359 --> 08:43.900
We had a chat

08:43.920 --> 08:45.150
and drank together.

08:50.760 --> 08:52.839
If so, that means they're your proteges.

08:53.719 --> 08:55.339
But they don't know who I am.

08:55.359 --> 08:56.719
That's not important.

08:56.880 --> 08:58.579
To other people,

08:58.599 --> 09:02.040
those candidates
are already your proteges.

09:05.839 --> 09:08.419
Father, forget about his proteges.

09:08.439 --> 09:09.400
Even Master Zhuang Mohan

09:09.400 --> 09:11.339
gave him all of his books.

09:11.359 --> 09:13.140
He's part of the literary succession.

09:13.160 --> 09:14.839
It's normal for him to have proteges.

09:14.839 --> 09:16.239
Don't interrupt us.

09:18.439 --> 09:19.740
Mr. Fan,

09:19.760 --> 09:24.320
what do you think the candidates
hate the most during the exam?

09:28.079 --> 09:29.960
Cheating and a showing of favoritism.

09:31.120 --> 09:34.959
Your proteges represent that.

09:41.839 --> 09:44.359
But Fan Xian doesn't intend
to practice favoritism.

09:44.359 --> 09:46.280
Why should we worry about it?

09:46.400 --> 09:49.339
Even if he doesn't want
to do certain deeds,

09:49.359 --> 09:51.359
other people will do them on his behalf.

09:51.439 --> 09:53.079
Why are they helping him out?

09:57.199 --> 10:00.479
How did you manage to infiltrate
Northern Qi when you're this dense?

10:01.040 --> 10:01.520
Father,

10:01.520 --> 10:05.560
what has the exam got to do
with Northern Qi now?

10:14.475 --> 10:18.770
[Fan's Residence]

10:23.120 --> 10:24.200
Madam Liu?

10:24.240 --> 10:25.220
Sizhe?

10:25.240 --> 10:26.320
Xian.

10:26.880 --> 10:28.479
Do you guys need anything?

10:29.880 --> 10:30.860
What are you doing?

10:30.880 --> 10:31.719
Don't stop me.

10:31.719 --> 10:32.670
- What's going on?
- I don't know either.

10:32.679 --> 10:33.479
Stop messing around. Let me go.

10:33.479 --> 10:35.179
Are you still vying for
the family inheritance with Fan Xian?

10:35.199 --> 10:37.059
What nonsense are you talking about?

10:37.079 --> 10:38.120
That was a long time ago.

10:38.120 --> 10:39.579
Now, we're a family.

10:39.599 --> 10:40.980
I need him to do me a favor.

10:41.000 --> 10:42.539
Even so, you shouldn't
harm him because of it.

10:42.559 --> 10:43.439
What do you mean?

10:43.439 --> 10:44.260
What were you doing just now?

10:44.260 --> 10:45.040
Sizhe is right.

10:45.040 --> 10:45.679
You're my elder.

10:45.679 --> 10:47.040
If people saw that
you knelt in front of me,

10:47.040 --> 10:48.520
I'll be in huge trouble.

10:48.559 --> 10:48.920
Wait.

10:48.940 --> 10:50.100
There are only the three of us here.

10:50.100 --> 10:51.160
No one else saw that.

10:51.160 --> 10:51.679
I'll do it quickly!

10:51.679 --> 10:52.479
Don't!

10:52.479 --> 10:53.559
I talk too fast, Mother.

10:53.559 --> 10:55.160
I can't help it.

10:55.400 --> 10:56.100
Madam Liu,

10:56.120 --> 10:58.020
we're a family.

10:58.040 --> 10:59.000
There's no need to beg me.

10:59.000 --> 11:01.220
We can talk inside.

11:01.240 --> 11:02.459
Let's talk inside.

11:02.479 --> 11:03.640
Come, Mother.

11:04.839 --> 11:06.160
Here, Madam Liu.

11:06.470 --> 11:07.680
Have some water.

11:11.120 --> 11:12.200
Thank you, Xian.

11:17.000 --> 11:18.440
How do I put it?

11:19.599 --> 11:20.800
You see,

11:20.839 --> 11:23.000
I'm getting older and older.

11:23.000 --> 11:24.560
Madam Liu, you're forever young.

11:25.319 --> 11:27.539
You're so good at pleasing people.

11:27.559 --> 11:29.579
If only Sizhe was as eloquent as you.

11:29.599 --> 11:30.479
He was a mischievous child

11:30.479 --> 11:31.860
since young.

11:31.880 --> 11:33.939
Sometimes, he does irk me.

11:33.959 --> 11:35.939
But when I don't see him,

11:35.959 --> 11:37.479
I miss him.

11:37.599 --> 11:40.079
I don't know if it's because
I owed him in my past life.

11:40.640 --> 11:42.640
Madam Liu, what are you
trying to get at?

11:46.359 --> 11:48.199
Can you not send him
to Northern Qi again?

11:50.640 --> 11:51.500
Madam Liu, don't worry.

11:51.520 --> 11:52.559
I don't intend for Sizhe

11:52.559 --> 11:54.599
to leave the Capital again
now that he's back.

11:55.280 --> 11:56.140
Really?

11:56.160 --> 11:57.839
You haven't asked me about it.

11:57.959 --> 11:59.330
I want to go to Northern Qi.

11:59.400 --> 12:02.479
But Fan Xian said
you didn't need to go there again.

12:03.280 --> 12:04.199
This doesn't concern him.

12:04.199 --> 12:06.079
I want to go there myself.

12:06.160 --> 12:07.299
But why?

12:07.319 --> 12:08.240
I've learned a lot from

12:08.240 --> 12:10.100
my trip to Northern Qi.

12:10.120 --> 12:11.319
Although it was dangerous

12:11.319 --> 12:11.959
and harsh...

12:11.959 --> 12:13.280
You shouldn't go there, then.

12:13.280 --> 12:14.860
Mother, let me finish my words.

12:14.880 --> 12:17.320
I found a reason to live.

12:18.079 --> 12:19.100
In the past,

12:19.120 --> 12:20.299
I always lived in the Capital.

12:20.319 --> 12:21.579
Yes. It's safe,

12:21.599 --> 12:22.710
and I don't need to fret.

12:22.730 --> 12:24.579
But I only indulge myself
in pleasures all day long.

12:24.599 --> 12:26.320
What's the point of living?

12:27.079 --> 12:28.419
When I went to Northern Qi,

12:28.439 --> 12:30.579
at least I felt useful as a person.

12:30.599 --> 12:33.560
Although I only did
the Qing State a small favor,

12:33.719 --> 12:35.160
I think that's enough.

12:36.240 --> 12:37.520
I don't wish to return to the past

12:37.520 --> 12:38.880
and become the bored

12:38.880 --> 12:40.719
and insignificant Fan Sizhe again.

12:42.479 --> 12:44.939
If so, are you still
heading to Northern Qi?

12:44.959 --> 12:46.400
For what?

12:50.839 --> 12:52.320
I'll go to you.

12:55.040 --> 12:56.159
Xian,

12:57.479 --> 12:59.520
I heard that you're going
to do business with Northern Qi

12:59.540 --> 13:00.880
after taking over the Imperial Treasury.

13:00.880 --> 13:02.079
That's true.

13:03.400 --> 13:05.980
Have you decided on a manager yet?

13:06.000 --> 13:06.940
Not yet.

13:06.960 --> 13:08.720
I've decided on the candidate for you.

13:12.079 --> 13:13.839
Why are you trying to take this path?

13:14.679 --> 13:16.020
I'm a citizen of the Qing State.

13:16.040 --> 13:18.350
I'm just contributing to my own state.

13:18.370 --> 13:19.520
Any other reasons?

13:20.839 --> 13:24.500
I also want to make some profit.

13:24.520 --> 13:26.199
I wish to make some money.

13:26.880 --> 13:28.239
Let me ask you something.

13:28.599 --> 13:30.199
Why should I choose you?

13:30.439 --> 13:31.719
Why wouldn't you choose me?

13:31.719 --> 13:33.079
As brothers, we should be united.

13:33.079 --> 13:34.939
Can you rest at ease
if you leave the post to someone else?

13:34.959 --> 13:36.439
I can rest at ease if I leave it to you.

13:36.439 --> 13:36.959
Yeah.

13:36.959 --> 13:39.000
The thing is,
it depends on Madam Liu's will.

13:39.280 --> 13:40.360
Mother.

13:45.400 --> 13:47.800
When do you plan to leave?

13:48.240 --> 13:49.680
Is that a yes?

13:50.400 --> 13:52.260
I want to see you grow up too.

13:52.280 --> 13:53.659
All right. I'll pack my belongings.

13:53.679 --> 13:55.359
I'll depart tomorrow morning.

13:55.559 --> 13:56.839
There's no rush.

13:56.959 --> 13:59.299
I'll hold my wedding
after the spring exam.

13:59.319 --> 14:01.220
You should attend it before leaving.

14:01.240 --> 14:02.699
All right. That's great.

14:02.719 --> 14:03.959
When's the spring exam?

14:05.280 --> 14:05.640
This is bad.

14:05.640 --> 14:06.500
I'm nervous.

14:06.520 --> 14:07.740
I didn't sleep well last night.

14:07.760 --> 14:09.400
Your snore was comparable
to the sound of a cannon.

14:09.400 --> 14:11.860
I was the one who didn't sleep well.

14:11.880 --> 14:13.040
Hou,

14:13.079 --> 14:15.199
I think I've reached a certain stage.

14:15.400 --> 14:16.559
When I was home,

14:16.559 --> 14:17.740
I memorized all of the books.

14:17.760 --> 14:19.260
But I forgot half of them
on my way here.

14:19.280 --> 14:19.980
Now that I'm here,

14:20.000 --> 14:21.339
I forgot everything.

14:21.359 --> 14:22.400
Sober up!

14:22.400 --> 14:23.820
The exam is nearing.

14:23.840 --> 14:25.119
Where's Cheng Jialin?

14:25.280 --> 14:26.479
He said he went to buy some flatbread.

14:26.479 --> 14:27.780
He told us to go first.

14:27.800 --> 14:28.980
Be careful!

14:29.000 --> 14:30.220
Be careful!

14:30.240 --> 14:32.140
There are so many people here.

14:32.160 --> 14:33.359
10,000 carps vie in the current,

14:33.360 --> 14:35.020
fighting for a chance
to leap over the Dragon Gate!

14:35.040 --> 14:35.900
Yeah!

14:35.920 --> 14:37.299
The end of this road

14:37.319 --> 14:40.160
represents the hope of all scholars!

14:40.560 --> 14:41.760
Sorry about that.

14:42.000 --> 14:43.280
Come.

14:43.880 --> 14:44.359
Hou,

14:44.359 --> 14:45.860
I think you slept pretty well.

14:45.880 --> 14:47.600
At least you have the energy to shout.

14:47.839 --> 14:50.560
All the squeezing is giving me energy.

14:52.359 --> 14:53.520
Be careful.

14:57.319 --> 14:58.399
Sorry.

15:03.800 --> 15:05.720
[Spring Exam Exam Hall]

15:17.880 --> 15:19.280
Mr. Fan.

15:20.800 --> 15:22.059
Mr. Guo, why are you here?

15:22.079 --> 15:23.520
It's almost time.

15:23.880 --> 15:25.579
The candidates will enter the hall soon.

15:25.599 --> 15:26.659
It's been tough on them.

15:26.679 --> 15:29.260
They studied all their lives
for the sake of these three days.

15:29.280 --> 15:32.220
The scholars are not to leave
the hall within these three days.

15:32.240 --> 15:35.260
That's why they brought
their blankets and food with them.

15:35.280 --> 15:36.130
It must've been tough.

15:36.150 --> 15:37.790
Since they're bringing
plenty of things here,

15:37.790 --> 15:39.830
that means they have a better chance
to smuggle cheat sheets as well.

15:39.839 --> 15:43.640
Mr. Fan, you're in charge
of the candidate inspection.

15:44.040 --> 15:45.980
This first hurdle
is of utmost importance.

15:46.000 --> 15:47.459
I'm quite worried about it.

15:47.479 --> 15:48.800
I came here to take a look

15:48.839 --> 15:50.819
so that you wouldn't
overlook any mistakes.

15:50.839 --> 15:53.560
Mr. Guo, you're truly nice.

15:55.280 --> 15:58.350
It's only natural to nurture younger generations,
don't you think?

16:00.920 --> 16:02.840
You're getting
your portraits drawn again?

16:04.040 --> 16:05.579
We're running out of time.

16:05.599 --> 16:07.800
I have to get it drawn
as quickly as possible.

16:11.079 --> 16:11.540
Don't worry.

16:11.560 --> 16:12.980
I've already checked the rule book.

16:13.000 --> 16:14.260
It doesn't go against the law

16:14.280 --> 16:15.640
or break the rules.

16:15.760 --> 16:17.040
Mr. Guo, you do obey the rules, huh?

16:17.040 --> 16:18.479
I'm an educated individual.

16:18.599 --> 16:20.079
I know my limits.

16:21.359 --> 16:23.359
Mr. Guo, what are you...

16:24.959 --> 16:26.760
This is a work log.

16:28.679 --> 16:29.500
Mr. Guo,

16:29.520 --> 16:31.079
you should do it like this.

16:31.280 --> 16:32.500
It shows more power.

16:32.520 --> 16:32.900
Is that so?

16:32.920 --> 16:34.040
It's more powerful.

16:34.520 --> 16:36.680
Your emotion! That's important.

16:51.400 --> 16:52.780
Look at the time.

16:52.800 --> 16:54.490
Why aren't the candidates here yet?

16:55.319 --> 16:57.160
Mr. Fan, you may not know,

16:57.319 --> 16:59.220
but according to
the established customs,

16:59.240 --> 17:00.260
the candidates

17:00.280 --> 17:03.220
are busy crossing
the Dragon Gate Bridge at this moment.

17:03.240 --> 17:04.520
Dragon Gate Bridge?

17:11.040 --> 17:13.079
I'll surely pass the exam!

17:14.280 --> 17:16.399
I crossed the Dragon Gate Bridge!

17:16.760 --> 17:18.339
I crossed the Dragon Gate Bridge!

17:18.359 --> 17:21.720
We'll surely pass the exam
after crossing the bridge!

17:42.800 --> 17:44.599
We've arrived!

17:44.800 --> 17:47.320
We've arrived!

17:56.040 --> 17:57.119
There are so many people here.

17:57.119 --> 17:58.240
Yeah.

18:16.839 --> 18:18.039
Here they come.

18:31.879 --> 18:33.379
Good morning, everyone.

18:33.399 --> 18:34.780
I'm Fan Xian.

18:34.800 --> 18:36.240
That's the Immortal Poet.

18:36.480 --> 18:38.320
He's the future grandmaster
of the literary world.

18:38.340 --> 18:39.420
That's right.

18:40.720 --> 18:42.439
Let me take a look.

18:43.079 --> 18:44.599
That's the grandmaster
of the literary world.

18:44.599 --> 18:45.800
It's rare to see him.

18:47.879 --> 18:50.139
Today's the spring exam.

18:50.159 --> 18:50.879
That's right.

18:50.879 --> 18:53.119
I have some wishes for you guys.

18:53.150 --> 18:55.180
May you all carry the golden key
to the treasury of wisdom,

18:55.200 --> 18:56.859
with a mind full of ten thousand books,

18:56.879 --> 18:58.119
wear the halo of confidence,

18:58.119 --> 18:59.619
ride the skateboard of good fortune,

18:59.639 --> 19:00.720
set sail with full confidence,

19:00.720 --> 19:02.210
and sail towards the heights...

19:02.359 --> 19:04.839
I mean, sail toward
the shore of success.

19:05.280 --> 19:06.520
You guys can do this.

19:06.639 --> 19:07.760
Rise up!

19:10.319 --> 19:12.119
Now that I'm done with the wishes,

19:12.200 --> 19:15.359
I have something unpleasant
to say as well.

19:17.559 --> 19:18.599
For this spring exam,

19:18.599 --> 19:21.679
I'm in charge
of the candidate inspection.

19:22.240 --> 19:25.399
If any of you brought something
that you weren't supposed to,

19:25.680 --> 19:28.159
please leave them here
before entering the hall.

19:28.960 --> 19:31.139
If we find such items on you
after you enter the hall,

19:31.159 --> 19:33.200
your qualifications will be canceled.

19:33.200 --> 19:35.119
There's no room for negotiation.

19:35.879 --> 19:36.960
I hereby

19:37.119 --> 19:38.399
implore you all to do so.

19:41.200 --> 19:42.480
Mr. Fan gave us the message.

19:42.490 --> 19:44.560
We cannot bring cheat sheets
into the exam hall.

19:48.040 --> 19:50.399
Yeah. It'll affect our future.

19:50.760 --> 19:52.280
Let's take them out, then.

20:13.275 --> 20:21.020
[Zhang Shenglin]

20:21.399 --> 20:22.479
Go now.

20:23.200 --> 20:24.379
Queue over there.

20:24.399 --> 20:25.619
One by one.

20:25.639 --> 20:27.960
Prepare your documents
for us to confirm your identity.

20:28.040 --> 20:29.120
All right.

20:29.639 --> 20:31.240
This is yours. Here you go.

20:32.399 --> 20:33.479
Next.

20:33.760 --> 20:34.840
Over here.

20:36.159 --> 20:37.520
Queue over here.

20:39.390 --> 20:40.480
Who brought the cheat sheets here?

20:40.490 --> 20:41.619
All right now. Just take them out.

20:41.639 --> 20:43.099
It'll be terrible if they find out.

20:43.119 --> 20:44.760
You, show me your bag.

20:45.200 --> 20:47.299
Mr. Guo, you shouldn't
stand all the time.

20:47.319 --> 20:48.299
Get him a chair.

20:48.319 --> 20:49.439
No need for that.

20:49.720 --> 20:52.440
He needs to draw another portrait
if I change my pose.

20:52.440 --> 20:53.520
One by one.

20:55.559 --> 20:57.159
Mr. Fan, you may proceed.

20:57.440 --> 20:58.379
I'll leave once I'm done.

20:58.399 --> 21:00.040
Thank you, Mr. Guo.

21:00.079 --> 21:01.240
It's my duty.

21:01.399 --> 21:03.339
Inspect everything thoroughly.

21:03.359 --> 21:04.579
Okay.

21:04.599 --> 21:05.919
Okay. Next.

21:07.919 --> 21:09.560
Here you go. You may go.

21:10.200 --> 21:11.599
Come and queue up.

21:11.839 --> 21:13.400
Where are Jichang and Jialin?

21:13.559 --> 21:14.500
I think they're in front.

21:14.520 --> 21:15.720
They won't get lost.

21:15.879 --> 21:17.240
Let's go inside.

21:17.440 --> 21:19.679
I wonder where's Mr. Fan.

21:20.559 --> 21:21.720
Next.

21:22.280 --> 21:22.980
Coming.

21:23.000 --> 21:24.679
Come. Leave your belongings here.

21:28.110 --> 21:30.270
Someone did try
to smuggle their cheat sheets.

21:34.720 --> 21:35.980
Were we too late?

21:36.000 --> 21:37.679
Is that why we don't get to see Mr. Fan?

21:38.919 --> 21:40.590
We'll see him once we enter the hall.

21:44.639 --> 21:45.460
Mr. Fan!

21:45.480 --> 21:47.200
Mr. Fan, I know my fault now!

21:47.280 --> 21:48.260
Mr. Fan!

21:48.280 --> 21:49.560
Hurry!

21:49.919 --> 21:50.619
Leave!

21:50.639 --> 21:52.760
Mr. Fan I know my fault now!

21:52.760 --> 21:54.099
Mr. Fan!

21:54.119 --> 21:56.639
Mr. Fan, I know my fault now!

21:56.639 --> 21:58.320
Mr. Fan!

21:58.760 --> 22:00.960
I'm sure he smuggled
cheat sheets into the hall too.

22:01.200 --> 22:02.520
Shameless fool.

22:02.559 --> 22:03.060
You deserve it.

22:03.080 --> 22:05.280
All those years of studying
were wasted on him.

22:05.839 --> 22:06.890
It'll be our turn soon.

22:06.910 --> 22:09.550
I heard that Mr. Fan would inspect
our belongings personally.

22:09.879 --> 22:11.320
Since he's the Immortal Poet,

22:11.639 --> 22:13.359
what do you think he looks like?

22:14.639 --> 22:17.180
Please give me another chance!

22:17.200 --> 22:18.720
Mr. Fan!

22:19.359 --> 22:22.320
I know my fault now!

22:23.399 --> 22:24.560
Turn around.

22:27.839 --> 22:29.159
Okay. Over here.

22:30.150 --> 22:31.520
Leave your blanket here.

22:37.200 --> 22:37.839
Move forward.

22:37.839 --> 22:39.139
Excuse me.

22:39.159 --> 22:41.800
Who's that person sitting over there?

22:42.079 --> 22:44.679
Don't you even recognize Mr. Fan Xian?

22:45.760 --> 22:46.980
Is he Fan Xian?

22:47.000 --> 22:48.359
Do not raise your voice.

22:48.879 --> 22:49.410
Turn around.

22:49.430 --> 22:50.660
Are my eyes playing tricks on me?

22:50.680 --> 22:52.960
Isn't he the guy who had a chat with us?

22:53.359 --> 22:55.159
He's actually the Immortal Poet?

22:59.960 --> 23:01.679
It's him indeed.

23:07.800 --> 23:09.420
[Yang Wanli]

23:10.520 --> 23:11.679
Go now.

23:11.839 --> 23:12.919
Next.

23:28.280 --> 23:29.360
What is this?

23:30.110 --> 23:31.480
Vegetable flatbread.

23:41.159 --> 23:43.119
Mr. Fan, there's a note inside.

23:43.639 --> 23:44.800
How could that be...

23:45.240 --> 23:46.480
Go over there!

23:47.000 --> 23:48.520
I didn't bring any cheat sheets!

24:01.599 --> 24:02.679
What is this, then?

24:03.599 --> 24:04.680
He's pretty bold, isn't he?

24:04.680 --> 24:06.119
Does he want to fail the exam?

24:06.159 --> 24:07.239
Sir,

24:08.520 --> 24:10.119
I have no idea.

24:11.319 --> 24:12.619
I truly...

24:12.639 --> 24:13.930
I truly have no idea about this.

24:13.950 --> 24:14.940
I can testify for him!

24:14.960 --> 24:16.059
Yang is an extraordinary talent!

24:16.079 --> 24:17.819
He would never commit such a deed!

24:17.839 --> 24:19.099
What's your name?

24:19.119 --> 24:20.439
Where do you come from?

24:20.680 --> 24:22.040
I'm Yang Wanli.

24:22.520 --> 24:23.700
I come from Quanzhou.

24:23.720 --> 24:25.000
Yang Wanli?

24:26.079 --> 24:27.159
That's right.

24:30.399 --> 24:31.599
Mr. Fan,

24:33.639 --> 24:35.720
isn't he your protege?

24:36.119 --> 24:37.839
Fan Xian met them before?

24:38.079 --> 24:39.650
Seems like these four candidates

24:39.670 --> 24:41.559
[Cheng Jialin, Yang Wanli]
are regarded highly by Fan Xian.

24:41.572 --> 24:42.559
[Hou Jichang, Shi Chanli]

24:42.559 --> 24:44.399
We'll start with them.

24:45.760 --> 24:47.200
Do away with all four of them.

24:48.839 --> 24:50.679
That's going too far.

24:51.200 --> 24:52.320
Pick one.

24:57.910 --> 24:59.119
Yang Wanli, then.

25:01.440 --> 25:02.800
Mr. Fan's protege?

25:03.359 --> 25:04.720
I'm not!

25:06.079 --> 25:08.240
What should we do?

25:15.359 --> 25:16.919
In my opinion,

25:19.280 --> 25:20.720
the spring exam
should be clean and fair.

25:20.720 --> 25:21.919
It has to be fair.

25:22.280 --> 25:25.000
If so, should we follow the rules?

25:30.800 --> 25:31.819
All right.

25:31.839 --> 25:32.919
Okay.

25:34.280 --> 25:37.579
Rescind the qualifications of
Yang Wanli, a student from Quanzhou.

25:37.599 --> 25:38.560
Chase him out of the exam hall.

25:38.580 --> 25:39.640
Ministry of Rites, record this.

25:39.660 --> 25:40.780
He shall never be recruited!

25:40.800 --> 25:42.020
It wasn't me.

25:42.040 --> 25:43.260
It wasn't me!

25:43.280 --> 25:44.639
It wasn't me!

25:44.720 --> 25:46.119
It wasn't me!

25:46.720 --> 25:48.240
Mr. Guo, please pardon me!

25:50.919 --> 25:52.359
Pardon you for what?

25:52.839 --> 25:53.919
Mr. Guo,

25:54.040 --> 25:56.679
I stuffed the note inside
in secret just now.

25:59.919 --> 26:00.899
You stuffed

26:00.919 --> 26:02.090
the note inside?

26:02.110 --> 26:03.099
That's right.

26:03.119 --> 26:04.439
But why?

26:06.319 --> 26:07.619
I was never born to study.

26:07.639 --> 26:08.410
I had no future.

26:08.430 --> 26:09.760
It felt unfair to me.

26:09.960 --> 26:11.740
That's why I wanted
to trick a student for fun.

26:11.760 --> 26:13.560
For fun?

26:13.680 --> 26:14.859
You want to trick him?

26:14.879 --> 26:16.070
I'm evil and devious.

26:16.090 --> 26:18.260
If so, why are you
confessing to your crime, then?

26:18.680 --> 26:20.480
He looked pitiful.

26:21.560 --> 26:23.059
I suddenly had a change of heart.

26:23.079 --> 26:25.020
That's pure nonsense.

26:25.040 --> 26:25.980
Mr. Guo,

26:26.000 --> 26:27.320
I'm speaking the truth.

26:28.150 --> 26:29.859
Who'll believe something like that?

26:29.879 --> 26:31.119
Mr. Guo,

26:31.359 --> 26:32.439
don't be angry.

26:33.079 --> 26:34.300
You're not young anymore.

26:34.320 --> 26:35.879
Your health will be affected.

26:40.399 --> 26:41.260
I'm ashamed.

26:41.280 --> 26:42.099
Shut up for now.

26:42.119 --> 26:43.260
All right.

26:44.760 --> 26:45.579
Mr. Fan,

26:45.599 --> 26:47.359
Yang is not a person like that.

26:48.599 --> 26:49.760
Mr. Guo,

26:49.960 --> 26:52.480
I don't know the rules
within the Ministry of Rites.

26:52.839 --> 26:54.180
May I ask you something?

26:54.200 --> 26:55.139
Ask away.

26:55.159 --> 26:57.970
Just now, you said that you wanted
to kick him out of the exam hall.

26:57.970 --> 26:59.440
You wanted the Ministry of Rites
to record it, right?

26:59.440 --> 27:00.919
Indeed.

27:01.559 --> 27:03.480
If so, that's quite a harsh punishment.

27:03.879 --> 27:05.599
What crime has he committed, then?

27:05.840 --> 27:07.280
He smuggled cheat sheets
into the exam hall.

27:07.280 --> 27:08.819
That shows his poor character.

27:08.839 --> 27:09.940
Where's the cheat sheet, then?

27:09.960 --> 27:11.040
This.

27:11.599 --> 27:12.539
Mr. Fan,

27:12.559 --> 27:13.839
everyone saw it.

27:13.839 --> 27:14.460
I did that.

27:14.480 --> 27:14.940
Shut up.

27:14.960 --> 27:15.780
All right.

27:15.800 --> 27:16.890
You were referring to this?

27:16.910 --> 27:18.319
If you want to press charges
against him,

27:18.319 --> 27:19.350
this is considered evidence.

27:19.359 --> 27:20.630
Why don't we open it

27:20.760 --> 27:22.139
and see what it is?

27:22.159 --> 27:23.180
Of course.

27:23.200 --> 27:24.679
We have to.

27:24.879 --> 27:26.320
I wish to see

27:27.399 --> 27:29.560
its content as well.

27:32.960 --> 27:34.740
Meat flatbread, two qian per piece.

27:34.760 --> 27:36.410
Flatbread, half a qian per piece.

27:36.430 --> 27:37.760
Vegetable flatbread...

27:40.240 --> 27:42.200
These are just
the prices of the flatbread.

27:42.800 --> 27:46.320
Are the prices of the flatbread
determined by the sages as well?

27:46.680 --> 27:48.399
I thought it was a cheat sheet.

27:52.159 --> 27:53.240
The menu is pretty complete.

27:53.250 --> 27:54.740
They also sell preserved vegetables.

27:54.760 --> 27:55.840
This is...

27:56.119 --> 27:57.420
Since it's just the price list,

27:57.440 --> 27:58.579
why did you hide it in the basket?

27:58.599 --> 27:59.780
What's inside the basket?

27:59.800 --> 28:01.359
Vegetable flatbread...

28:05.399 --> 28:07.059
If so, is it possible

28:07.079 --> 28:09.639
that the shopkeeper
put it inside by accident?

28:12.159 --> 28:14.200
Or, maybe I was mistaken.

28:14.559 --> 28:16.800
Maybe the sages did say

28:17.159 --> 28:18.960
that meat flatbread

28:18.960 --> 28:20.439
costs two qian per piece, huh?

28:20.480 --> 28:22.200
Mr. Guo, why don't you
check the records?

28:29.680 --> 28:32.720
You shouldn't have
oily food for all three meals.

28:33.040 --> 28:34.839
You should have some normal flatbread.

28:37.200 --> 28:38.280
Yes, Mr. Guo.

28:38.560 --> 28:39.919
I'll remember your words.

28:40.280 --> 28:41.020
Go inside now.

28:41.040 --> 28:42.120
Go now.

28:42.599 --> 28:43.619
Let's go.

28:43.639 --> 28:44.719
Let's go!

28:52.599 --> 28:53.780
What's your deal?

28:53.800 --> 28:55.379
Mr. Fan, I slept too much.

28:55.399 --> 28:56.299
Nonsense!

28:56.319 --> 28:57.890
The candidate inspection
is a major event!

28:57.910 --> 28:59.180
I'll deduct your salary for one month!

28:59.200 --> 29:00.830
Yes, Mr. Fan. I accept my punishment.

29:02.480 --> 29:03.960
Mr. Guo, what do you think?

29:05.040 --> 29:06.200
Mr. Fan,

29:07.040 --> 29:09.339
please tend to the affairs here.

29:09.359 --> 29:11.579
I still need to check the exam papers.

29:11.599 --> 29:12.760
I'm exhausted.

29:12.910 --> 29:13.820
I have no time to be idle.

29:13.840 --> 29:15.159
I have no time to be idle.

29:15.559 --> 29:17.220
Thank you, Mr. Guo.

29:17.240 --> 29:19.240
Farewell, Mr. Guo.

29:39.560 --> 29:40.740
Who taught you to do that?

29:40.760 --> 29:43.399
Mr. Fan, I serve Prime Minister Lin.

29:45.150 --> 29:46.619
It was Prime Minister Lin's will.

29:46.639 --> 29:47.570
I'll be your scapegoat

29:47.590 --> 29:48.859
if anything happens during the exam.

29:48.879 --> 29:50.379
What about your life?

29:50.399 --> 29:51.520
This is my duty.

29:54.559 --> 29:56.000
Relay my message to Mr. Lin.

29:56.960 --> 29:59.079
Tell him
that I appreciate his protection.

29:59.240 --> 30:01.679
However, I'll deal with the exam myself.

30:15.319 --> 30:16.379
Mr. Fan,

30:16.399 --> 30:20.090
out of the four scholars
Deng Ziyue was protecting,

30:20.110 --> 30:22.260
only Yang Wanli was accused
of smuggling cheat sheets.

30:22.280 --> 30:23.360
Who did it?

30:23.839 --> 30:24.960
Xie Bi'an.

30:25.200 --> 30:26.599
I'm correct, then.

30:26.870 --> 30:28.639
Guo Zheng belongs to Chengze's faction.

30:30.399 --> 30:33.119
All the squeezing is giving me energy.

30:33.800 --> 30:35.240
Stop squeezing!

30:39.879 --> 30:41.030
Sorry about that!

30:41.359 --> 30:42.379
Stop squeezing!

30:42.399 --> 30:43.639
Be careful!

30:44.520 --> 30:48.099
Guo Zheng is pretty vicious himself.

30:48.119 --> 30:49.639
This is only the beginning.

30:50.240 --> 30:51.830
The exam will last for three days.

30:52.079 --> 30:55.359
Let's have some fun with Mr. Guo.

31:26.359 --> 31:27.439
Everyone,

31:27.520 --> 31:31.079
the exam is more than
just a test of your knowledge.

31:31.159 --> 31:32.780
It's also a test of your character.

31:32.800 --> 31:34.280
I wish you all

31:34.440 --> 31:36.059
a promising future.

31:36.079 --> 31:37.599
I also advise you guys

31:37.760 --> 31:39.480
to behave yourselves.

31:54.240 --> 31:55.599
It's time.

33:03.525 --> 33:06.295
[Spring exam serial number]

33:47.620 --> 33:48.879
Where's Cheng Jialin?

33:49.520 --> 33:50.830
He's in Room East Two.

33:55.280 --> 33:56.360
Stop.

34:00.000 --> 34:00.940
What are you guys doing?

34:00.960 --> 34:01.980
Mr. Fan,

34:02.000 --> 34:03.780
it's time to distribute the candles.

34:17.959 --> 34:20.680
Mr. Fan, you have a great reputation,

34:20.680 --> 34:22.680
and you have
all the authority in the world.

34:23.160 --> 34:26.839
Trivial affairs won't affect you much.

34:27.760 --> 34:30.299
If they want to ruin your reputation,

34:30.319 --> 34:32.140
they have to stir up huge trouble.

34:32.160 --> 34:33.720
And, the first incident

34:34.760 --> 34:36.200
is related to fire.

34:37.640 --> 34:41.859
The Ministry of Rites will
distribute candles to all candidates.

34:41.879 --> 34:43.100
In terms of responsibility,

34:43.120 --> 34:45.879
this must be handled by you.

34:47.200 --> 34:49.459
All of the candidates
are cramped together.

34:49.479 --> 34:51.190
If they tamper with the candles,

34:51.210 --> 34:52.840
what do you think will happen?

34:54.479 --> 34:55.559
A fire will start.

34:55.680 --> 34:57.959
What if thousands of rooms
are on fire at the same time?

34:57.959 --> 35:00.919
It may turn into a tragedy.

35:01.080 --> 35:03.240
If they wish to ruin your future,

35:03.919 --> 35:06.479
this is what they have to resort to.

35:06.760 --> 35:07.919
I smell kerosene.

35:08.080 --> 35:09.630
Don't distribute them for now.

35:10.230 --> 35:11.630
Don't distribute them.

35:13.280 --> 35:14.899
Fire prevention is of utmost importance

35:14.919 --> 35:17.839
in the inspection of the exam hall.

35:19.160 --> 35:21.220
However, in this manual,

35:21.240 --> 35:22.600
Guo Zheng

35:22.600 --> 35:24.060
just brushed things off.

35:24.080 --> 35:25.280
I predict

35:25.319 --> 35:28.320
that this is the trap
he set for you, Mr. Fan.

35:41.190 --> 35:43.039
These candles doused with kerosene too.

35:48.839 --> 35:49.919
Mr. Fan,

35:50.039 --> 35:52.339
even if the candles
are doused with kerosene,

35:52.359 --> 35:55.390
they'll only produce some sparks
when they're lit.

35:55.800 --> 35:57.220
Such sparks

35:57.240 --> 35:59.899
shouldn't cause any major fire.

35:59.919 --> 36:00.939
You're wrong.

36:00.959 --> 36:02.319
What if the candidates weren't

36:02.319 --> 36:04.039
tending to the candle while they rest?

36:04.720 --> 36:05.919
You do have a point.

36:06.359 --> 36:07.180
Think about it.

36:07.200 --> 36:09.220
Why do the candidates need the candles?

36:09.240 --> 36:11.899
It's because the exam hall is dark.

36:11.919 --> 36:14.100
They use the candles

36:14.120 --> 36:15.859
to illuminate their exam papers.

36:15.879 --> 36:16.939
That's right.

36:16.959 --> 36:18.499
The fire doesn't need to be huge.

36:18.519 --> 36:21.039
It's already a huge deal
if it burns the exam papers.

36:21.879 --> 36:24.210
That's a huge deal indeed.

36:24.230 --> 36:25.100
Did you guys hear that?

36:25.120 --> 36:26.879
This batch of candles is unusable.

36:27.879 --> 36:28.660
But Mr. Fan,

36:28.680 --> 36:31.800
where can we get this
many candles out of the blue?

36:53.080 --> 36:54.299
For the next three days,

36:54.319 --> 36:58.200
the Imperial Inspectorate will
supply the exam hall with candles.

36:58.240 --> 36:59.090
And,

36:59.110 --> 37:00.439
please deliver this

37:01.439 --> 37:04.760
to Mr. Guo.

37:10.039 --> 37:11.200
Thank you.

37:24.550 --> 37:24.999
[Imperial Inspectorate will provide the
candles. The sum is 200 silver taels.]

37:24.999 --> 37:26.379
Record this in the inventory record?

37:26.399 --> 37:27.220
What does this mean?

37:27.240 --> 37:28.919
The Imperial Inspectorate said...

37:29.120 --> 37:30.559
The Imperial Inspectorate

37:30.760 --> 37:33.999
is providing candles to the candidates.

37:34.200 --> 37:36.919
We're doing a good deed here.

37:37.519 --> 37:38.339
However,

37:38.359 --> 37:39.899
when it comes to business...

37:39.919 --> 37:40.740
No,

37:40.760 --> 37:41.819
I mean,

37:41.839 --> 37:44.399
officialdom is officialdom.

37:44.640 --> 37:45.859
Most importantly,

37:45.879 --> 37:47.839
we have to obey the rules.

37:48.359 --> 37:49.720
The Ministry of Rites

37:49.760 --> 37:51.839
was supposed to manage the exam.

37:51.999 --> 37:53.459
If so, the cost of these candles

37:53.479 --> 37:56.120
should also be borne
by the Ministry of Rites.

37:56.479 --> 37:57.559
Of course,

37:57.839 --> 38:00.540
since we're doing a good deed here,

38:00.560 --> 38:02.339
I can give you a 10% discount

38:02.359 --> 38:04.459
for the candles.

38:04.479 --> 38:06.260
Officialdom is officialdom?

38:06.280 --> 38:07.800
What kind of phrase is that?

38:07.940 --> 38:09.620
Besides, why is
the Imperial Inspectorate

38:09.640 --> 38:11.019
interfering with the candle supply?

38:11.039 --> 38:12.999
Didn't we have our own candles?

38:13.439 --> 38:15.660
Mr. Fan has a message for you.

38:15.680 --> 38:16.690
Mr. Guo,

38:16.710 --> 38:17.600
I was suddenly inspired

38:17.600 --> 38:18.680
for the past few days.

38:18.680 --> 38:19.939
I did divination.

38:19.959 --> 38:21.280
Guess what happened?

38:21.400 --> 38:23.940
It foretold that a firestorm
would happen. That's inauspicious.

38:23.960 --> 38:25.530
Therefore, I thought to myself

38:25.640 --> 38:27.120
that I should swap out
all of the candles.

38:27.120 --> 38:29.030
I should use the ones provided
by the Imperial Inspectorate.

38:29.030 --> 38:30.140
If anything happens,

38:30.160 --> 38:31.919
I'll bear all of the responsibilities.

38:32.200 --> 38:33.260
Of course,

38:33.280 --> 38:34.700
if you're not willing,

38:34.720 --> 38:37.290
we can inspect the candles
provided by your ministry again.

38:37.310 --> 38:38.379
If nothing's wrong with them,

38:38.399 --> 38:39.660
we can use them again.

38:39.680 --> 38:41.519
What do you think?

38:41.680 --> 38:43.220
The divination part

38:43.240 --> 38:45.519
was kind of a joke.

38:45.800 --> 38:46.660
Besides, usually,

38:46.680 --> 38:48.299
people say
"A bloody storm would happen."

38:48.319 --> 38:50.100
A firestorm doesn't exist.

38:50.120 --> 38:50.859
Mr. Guo,

38:50.879 --> 38:53.100
why don't we follow
Mr. Fan's instruction

38:53.120 --> 38:55.160
and inspect our candles again?

38:55.359 --> 38:58.200
Lord Fan is just concerned
about state affairs.

38:58.710 --> 39:00.280
At least his intention was good.

39:01.479 --> 39:03.240
I guess we can use the candles

39:03.640 --> 39:04.879
that they provide.

39:05.720 --> 39:07.919
But we have to pay for them.

39:08.439 --> 39:09.680
Pay them, then.

39:10.879 --> 39:11.959
Wait.

39:16.879 --> 39:19.280
Didn't they agree
to give us a 10% discount?

39:19.400 --> 39:21.519
Why is it more expensive
than its original price?

39:22.080 --> 39:23.720
Don't forget about the delivery fee.

39:29.999 --> 39:32.720
We can't afford to delay the exam.

39:34.830 --> 39:36.550
Just follow their instructions.

39:39.039 --> 39:39.280
Here.

39:39.280 --> 39:40.359
This is yours.

39:40.359 --> 39:40.860
Thank you.

39:40.880 --> 39:41.819
Be careful with it.

39:41.839 --> 39:42.419
Keep it safe.

39:42.439 --> 39:43.019
Okay.

39:43.039 --> 39:43.780
Be careful with it.

39:43.800 --> 39:44.899
- This is yours.
- Thank you.

39:44.919 --> 39:45.440
Thank you.

39:45.460 --> 39:46.419
Be careful with it.

39:46.439 --> 39:47.519
Thank you.

39:48.120 --> 39:48.939
Be careful with it.

39:48.959 --> 39:50.019
Here.

39:50.039 --> 39:50.819
- Here you go.
- Okay.

39:50.839 --> 39:52.039
Be careful with it.

39:52.760 --> 39:53.819
Be careful.

39:53.839 --> 39:54.620
Okay.

39:54.640 --> 39:55.459
Thank you.

39:55.479 --> 39:56.800
Thank you.

40:04.120 --> 40:05.419
Besides the fire issue,

40:05.439 --> 40:06.839
there's also a water issue.

40:09.280 --> 40:12.600
The water in the exam hall
is meant for the candidates.

40:12.680 --> 40:15.519
It serves as drinking water,
and it's also used to put out fires.

40:15.800 --> 40:18.120
If something's wrong with the water,

40:18.479 --> 40:21.879
all of the candidates will be affected.

40:25.399 --> 40:26.479
Mr. Fan.

40:28.240 --> 40:29.299
Is the water poisoned?

40:29.319 --> 40:30.399
It's not that bad.

40:30.839 --> 40:31.899
I'm glad to hear that.

40:31.919 --> 40:32.720
The water

40:32.720 --> 40:33.419
has almost gone bad.

40:33.439 --> 40:34.919
It won't last for three days.

40:34.999 --> 40:36.170
Mr. Fan, we've brought the water tanks

40:36.190 --> 40:38.030
from the First Division here
as per your instruction.

40:38.040 --> 40:39.240
Change all of them.

40:41.439 --> 40:42.480
Tread lightly.

40:42.500 --> 40:44.459
This time, don't charge them
for the delivery fee.

40:44.479 --> 40:45.800
Yes, Mr. Fan.

40:51.760 --> 40:52.840
Mr. Fan,

40:53.359 --> 40:55.060
shouldn't we try to blow up

40:55.080 --> 40:57.080
the issue with the tampered candles?

40:57.919 --> 40:59.879
The candles were
only doused with kerosene.

41:00.039 --> 41:01.640
It's not a huge deal yet.

41:01.760 --> 41:02.740
It'll only be a huge deal

41:02.760 --> 41:05.039
when there's a fire.

41:05.080 --> 41:07.100
But if a fire does break out,

41:07.120 --> 41:08.580
everything will be done for.

41:08.600 --> 41:09.720
Indeed.

41:10.039 --> 41:10.780
But...

41:10.800 --> 41:12.559
But have they never considered

41:13.039 --> 41:15.160
the lives of all these scholars here?

41:16.439 --> 41:17.640
What do you think?

41:19.280 --> 41:20.839
I'm truly perplexed.

41:20.959 --> 41:23.560
How could they talk about
being parental officials, then?

41:23.560 --> 41:25.080
Parental officials, my foot!

41:25.600 --> 41:27.859
Initially, I thought
I was already ruthless enough.

41:27.879 --> 41:30.280
I never expected them
to leave me in awe.

41:30.600 --> 41:33.550
It's better for such
tall-standing officials to fall.

41:35.039 --> 41:37.180
Think again.
What other oversights are there?

41:37.200 --> 41:39.760
We've resolved the issues
with both fire and water.

41:41.600 --> 41:43.419
Food, clothing, housing, transportation,

41:43.439 --> 41:45.439
eating, drinking, defecating,
and urinating?

41:45.479 --> 41:46.879
The food and drinks

41:46.959 --> 41:48.740
are brought here
by the candidates themselves.

41:48.760 --> 41:51.519
They can't just tamper
with them one by one.

42:30.359 --> 42:31.640
Where are they going?

42:31.919 --> 42:33.359
He's going to poop.

42:33.359 --> 42:34.720
They're heading to the loo.

42:35.439 --> 42:37.399
Isn't there a toilet
in each compartment?

42:37.919 --> 42:39.499
We used to do that in the past.

42:39.519 --> 42:41.899
However, the exam lasts for three days.

42:41.919 --> 42:42.939
The terrible stench

42:42.959 --> 42:44.819
will affect the candidates' performance.

42:44.839 --> 42:47.439
After that, we switched
to using the loo outside.

42:49.640 --> 42:51.680
That's the one thing we cannot avoid.

43:16.260 --> 43:18.260
♪ The youth raises his head ♪

43:18.260 --> 43:22.340
♪ As he moves toward his moon ♪

43:23.860 --> 43:25.980
♪ People tease him for being delusional ♪

43:25.980 --> 43:29.760
♪ Wondering why he is so unconventional ♪

43:31.780 --> 43:35.340
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

43:35.340 --> 43:39.260
♪ How could it remain unstained? ♪

43:39.260 --> 43:41.180
♪ If silver tael has a value ♪

43:41.180 --> 43:44.780
♪ Who can truly be carefree? ♪

43:45.500 --> 43:48.180
♪ All of you are right ♪

43:48.200 --> 43:50.420
♪ He said: "Please" ♪

43:50.420 --> 43:53.480
♪ "Make way" ♪

43:53.500 --> 43:55.980
♪ "Let me drink until I drop" ♪

43:55.980 --> 43:57.900
♪ On the court ♪

43:57.900 --> 44:00.920
♪ I recite several verses ♪

44:00.940 --> 44:03.340
♪ Let me wear a white robe ♪

44:03.340 --> 44:05.420
♪ And cross the alley
filled with insanity ♪

44:05.420 --> 44:08.640
♪ To scoop up the moon's reflection
in the muddy pond ♪

44:08.660 --> 44:10.900
♪ Sirs, please forgive me ♪

44:10.900 --> 44:12.860
♪ Your words of advice ♪

44:12.860 --> 44:15.880
♪ I understand,
but I don't want to pretend ♪

44:15.900 --> 44:18.190
♪ People search for the golden land ♪

44:18.190 --> 44:20.260
♪ While I search for the moon ♪

44:20.260 --> 44:22.720
♪ Why should we travel together? ♪

44:22.740 --> 44:24.660
♪ Thank you ♪

44:24.660 --> 44:26.740
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:26.740 --> 44:28.420
♪ You are you ♪

44:28.420 --> 44:30.320
♪ I am me ♪

44:30.340 --> 44:32.260
♪ Thank you ♪

44:32.260 --> 44:34.220
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:34.220 --> 44:36.020
♪ You are you ♪

44:36.020 --> 44:39.480
♪ I am me ♪

44:51.550 --> 44:54.770
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

44:55.150 --> 44:58.620
♪ Remarkably worldly-wise
yet hopelessly romantic ♪

44:58.870 --> 45:02.010
♪ Know what you love ♪

45:02.200 --> 45:04.770
♪ Don't change ♪

45:06.660 --> 45:10.090
♪ If one has witnessed
both light and shadow ♪

45:10.160 --> 45:13.790
♪ Yet retains their innocence ♪

45:13.810 --> 45:16.840
♪ They shall be cloaked in moonlight ♪

45:16.900 --> 45:20.100
♪ As they journey through the night ♪
